WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 012. THE MODEL IS NOT THE USE. Context changes consequence.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
BOUND. PURPOSE. PEOPLE. DECISION. Classify the real workflow.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
CONSEQUENCE. SEVERITY. SCALE. RIGHTS. REVERSIBILITY. Add vulnerability, sensitivity, uncertainty.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CONTROLS. OWNER. TEST. MONITOR. APPEAL. Higher consequence requires stronger architecture.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
HUMAN POWER. CHANGE. PAUSE. CONTEST. REMEDY. Review matters only when powers exist.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
BOUNDARY. A SCORE NEVER APPROVES. Escalate when consequence outruns control.
